    "## Data Transformation\n",
    "\n",
    "Before the images are used by the neural network, they are converted\n",
    "to PyTorch tensors using `transforms.ToTensor()`.\n",
    "\n",
    "This transformation converts the image data into a tensor representation\n",
    "that can be processed by PyTorch."
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": 4,
   "id": "d21ed567",
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [
    {
     "name": "stdout",
     "output_type": "stream",
     "text": [
      "Compose(\n",
      "    ToTensor()\n",
      ")\n",
      "FashionMNIST mirror updated.\n"
     ]
    },
    {
     "name": "stderr",
